%% The widget declarations of GSG's app (vGLP, Section 6.2, Definition "Widget Declaration"): the approval question of its platform, Approval, drawn by the construct family's approval_sentence, a sentence and the buttons Yes and No (glp_multiagent/lib/ui_runtime/named_widgets.dart).  They are the app's, not the platform's: platform.vglp stays as vGLP's compiler prints it.
Approval =::= approval_sentence.
